 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:58Z (RFD66606-2021) '  `strict_required_status_checks_policy` set to `true`, so a PR whose
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-2021) '  branch is behind `main` updates and re-runs its checks before it
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-2021) '  merges.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

